{
 "$comment": "Sci-fix ledger docs/evidence/sci-fixes.json (sci-fix improvement plan C6). Structure only, with the keywords contracts/schema.py implements and no $ref; grades against oracles, D scope, references to tests, sources, advisories and VALIDATION sections are checked in tests/tools/test_scifix_ledger.py.",
